- Generate a template file from one of the existing styles or start from scratch
- Edit the appropriate fields (such as author, title, year, etc.) in the template according to your desired citation format.
- Save the file with an appropriate name (e.g, chapter_1.bst). 4. Create a.tex file called `references.tex` which will hold all your bibliographies: ```
